  ],
  // Opt-in plain-GTK4 recolor, selected per launcher with GTK_THEME=qshell.
  // No launcher uses it since ripdrag left (2026-08-18) — see the template's
  // own header. Both filenames: with prefer-dark set GTK loads
  // gtk-dark.css and ignores gtk.css, on light themes the reverse — the
